            "source_type": "TARGET"
          }
        ],
        "rationale": "The target explicitly supplies reliable workload measurement as a case condition. The source requires reliable observation but does not independently establish this case-specific fact. The instruction invokes the condition without adding a measurement procedure."
      },
      "resolution": "GROUNDING_REF",
      "claim_ref": null,
      "provenance_refs": [
