      "materiality_rationale": "This is the supplied general premise connecting reliable workload observation and an agreed policy threshold to a prospective stopping rule.",
      "resolution_rationale": "The general permission is invoked without strengthening it into a supplied case-specific stopping command. The primary assertion remains MAPPING_GENERATED and GOVERNANCE_RULE."
